## 5. Locales defining `yearStart` (src/locale/*.js) — 8 files, all value 4
`en-gb.js:12`, `en-in.js:12`, `en-tt.js:12`, `fr.js:12`, `zh-cn.js:20`, `zh.js:20`, `cs.js:59`, `sk.js:60` — every one is exactly:
```js
